WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.080 --> 00:01.960
Don't want to date an engineering student?

3
00:01.960 --> 00:03.226
No.

4
00:03.900 --> 00:05.870
Then how about dating a soccer player?

5
00:05.870 --> 00:08.000
Are you really serious about him?

6
00:08.000 --> 00:09.126
Yeah.

7
00:11.050 --> 00:13.100
Master still wants to talk to you, Mr. Jinna.

8
00:13.100 --> 00:15.520
But your dad probably needs you.

9
00:15.520 --> 00:19.030
Does he want me or someone to take over his business?

10
00:19.030 --> 00:20.340
Probably the police station.

11
00:20.340 --> 00:24.560
I'm going to talk to the police about the laptop, the phone, and these earbuds.

12
00:24.560 --> 00:26.290
Don't give them to the police.

13
00:26.290 --> 00:28.560
Anda told me not to give them to the police.

14
00:28.560 --> 00:31.513
Could it be that someone made him take pills?

15
00:32.140 --> 00:33.330
Or drugged him.

16
00:33.330 --> 00:36.420
You know, Anda was always targeted by haters.

17
00:36.420 --> 00:39.140
There's this one account that's been stirring up all the hate.

18
00:39.140 --> 00:40.706
"Emma."

19
00:42.480 --> 00:43.706
"AM..."

20
00:45.280 --> 00:50.946
An account called "Andaman TH" has revealed the identity of Anda's hater.

21
00:53.550 --> 00:55.420
I've figured out who killed Anda.

22
00:55.420 --> 00:57.080
If Anda was really murdered,

23
00:57.080 --> 01:00.363
then I will bring the killer to justice myself.

24
01:03.376 --> 01:06.270
[Andaman Engineering Love Struck]

25
01:23.110 --> 01:24.926
Is there really no one here?

26
01:30.040 --> 01:33.506
I mean, if you really want to know, why don't you just knock on the door?

27
01:36.120 --> 01:38.006
Amp probably ran far away by now.

28
01:38.600 --> 01:39.880
That's creepy.

29
01:39.880 --> 01:42.233
A murderer is living right next door to you.

30
01:43.330 --> 01:45.615
I think...

31
01:45.615 --> 01:47.080
that...

32
01:47.080 --> 01:49.213
Don't leave me hanging. Tell me.

33
01:49.213 --> 01:51.660
Why do I feel like I don't suspect Amp?

34
01:51.660 --> 01:54.530
Hey. Get a grip, Podduang.

35
01:54.530 --> 01:56.750
A hater is a hater.

36
01:56.750 --> 02:01.420
We never know what people we share the elevator with are actually like.

37
02:02.080 --> 02:04.110
True, I saw it with my own eyes.

38
02:04.110 --> 02:07.453
Her hater-hunting skills are brutal.

39
02:08.160 --> 02:09.930
How about you next, Dunk?

40
02:09.930 --> 02:14.306
Jeez, when we're alone, you use all those sweet terms.

41
02:15.240 --> 02:16.653
Smartass.

42
02:18.720 --> 02:22.610
But Amp looks perfectly normal.

43
02:22.610 --> 02:26.800
Every time I see her, it feels like she's the one in danger.

44
02:26.800 --> 02:29.970
Hey, don't play the good guy now.

45
02:29.970 --> 02:31.750
But I'm being serious.

46
02:31.750 --> 02:33.540
It seems like she has her own problems.

47
02:33.540 --> 02:35.310
Well, that's because she did something wrong.

48
02:35.310 --> 02:38.530
We only have information, not evidence.

49
02:38.530 --> 02:42.513
Isn't it a bit harsh to accuse her of being a murderer?

50
02:44.650 --> 02:49.130
I know you two love Anda and are very upset about this.

51
02:49.130 --> 02:52.346
But I think we need to stay calm.

52
02:53.230 --> 02:55.170
Anyway, Podduang.

53
02:55.170 --> 02:59.160
That Amp next door knows you're an Anda fan.

54
02:59.160 --> 03:01.500
She's dangerous to you, after all.

55
03:01.500 --> 03:05.440
I think you shouldn't be here for now.

56
03:05.440 --> 03:09.270
I agree. Better safe than sorry.

57
03:09.270 --> 03:12.840
And if I'm not here, what about Satang?

58
03:12.840 --> 03:15.530
Are you really his brother?

59
03:15.530 --> 03:18.270
The freshman soccer players are at a training camp in Khao Yai.

60
03:18.270 --> 03:21.413
Oh, I didn't know about that.

61
03:25.940 --> 03:29.180
It reminds me of when the three of us lived together freshman year.

62
03:29.180 --> 03:30.790
Okay, I'll go then.

63
03:30.790 --> 03:33.000
- Hey! Wait, wait, wait. - Hold on.

64
03:33.000 --> 03:35.568
I wasn't going to have you stay with me.

65
03:35.568 --> 03:36.813
What?

66
03:38.520 --> 03:40.153
Then where am I supposed to stay?

67
03:53.600 --> 03:57.740
[Characters, places, and incidents in this production]

68
03:57.740 --> 03:59.200
[are entirely fictitious.]

69
03:59.200 --> 04:01.120
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

70
05:20.720 --> 05:22.666
Need help carrying anything?

71
05:25.120 --> 05:26.533
What's up?

72
05:27.800 --> 05:30.048
It's just that...

73
05:30.048 --> 05:31.260
What is it?

74
05:31.260 --> 05:33.600
You're acting like you've never slept with me before.

75
05:33.600 --> 05:35.430
What's with you, Jinna?

76
05:35.430 --> 05:37.613
I'm not going.

77
05:39.450 --> 05:40.520
Okay.

78
05:52.830 --> 05:54.000
Wait a minute.

79
05:54.000 --> 05:57.650
Since you're not going, I'm sleeping here instead.

80
05:57.650 --> 06:00.013
Why are you doing this?

81
06:03.470 --> 06:05.173
I'm just worried about you.

82
06:06.690 --> 06:10.280
It's not just me, you know.

83
06:10.280 --> 06:12.250
Your friends are worried, too.

84
06:12.250 --> 06:14.580
Everyone is worried about you.

85
06:15.690 --> 06:18.226
Okay, thanks.

86
06:19.510 --> 06:21.386
Do you want me to help you pack?

87
06:22.360 --> 06:24.906
No, it's fine. Just wait here.

88
06:43.670 --> 06:46.420
You were quite cute as a kid.

89
06:50.600 --> 06:51.900
What are you doing in here?

90
06:51.900 --> 06:53.520
Who let you in?

91
06:53.520 --> 06:56.356
Well, the door was open.

92
07:01.200 --> 07:02.830
[The Field of Love] [Dorm Mate]

93
07:02.830 --> 07:04.640
This corner is nice.

94
07:04.640 --> 07:08.730
Anda would be so happy to see that he had a fan like you.

95
07:08.730 --> 07:09.740
[Engineering Love Struck]

96
07:30.540 --> 07:33.333
I put it there because I miss Anda.

97
07:34.680 --> 07:37.050
I haven't said anything yet.

98
07:37.050 --> 07:38.960
It's up to you where you put it.

99
07:38.960 --> 07:40.450
[Dorm Mate] I just...

100
07:40.450 --> 07:44.480
noticed it was sitting there all by itself.

101
07:44.480 --> 07:46.480
The others are all over here.

102
07:46.480 --> 07:47.640
Done?

103
07:49.440 --> 07:51.400
Stop being so full of yourself.

104
07:54.480 --> 07:57.160
- Here, let me carry it. - No, it's fine.

105
08:02.470 --> 08:04.610
That's the guy who was with Itti.

106
08:04.610 --> 08:06.150
- Let go! - Go!

107
08:06.150 --> 08:07.273
Shit!

108
08:09.632 --> 08:11.106
What is he doing here?

109
08:16.210 --> 08:18.000
Hey.

110
08:18.000 --> 08:19.820
- Hello. - Hello.

111
08:20.766 --> 08:22.153
What are you doing here?

112
08:23.520 --> 08:27.770
I was told that the suspect was in this room.

113
08:27.770 --> 08:29.000
Yes.

114
08:29.900 --> 08:33.960
I never imagined that your room was right next to hers.

115
08:33.960 --> 08:36.533
No, sir. It's his room.

116
08:38.686 --> 08:40.544
In that case, let me ask you something.

117
08:40.544 --> 08:43.340
Have you ever talked to the person in the next room?

118
08:43.340 --> 08:44.600
I have, sir.

119
08:46.800 --> 08:48.433
Do you guys have any free time?

120
08:48.433 --> 08:50.853
Do you have to be anywhere else?

121
08:55.850 --> 08:57.590
Do we have to record it?

122
08:57.590 --> 08:58.970
Just speak freely.

123
08:58.970 --> 09:03.080
Because now I'm officially on this case as well.

124
09:03.080 --> 09:06.766
I'll definitely catch the person who did that to my brother.

125
09:07.946 --> 09:09.700
Yes, sir.

126
09:09.700 --> 09:13.533
The more information I get, the easier everything will be.

127
09:13.533 --> 09:14.813
All right?

128
09:16.486 --> 09:21.760
How long have you known Amp, your next-door neighbor?

129
09:21.760 --> 09:23.750
Not for very long.

130
09:23.750 --> 09:25.520
Right before Anda passed away.

131
09:25.520 --> 09:28.220
And how has she been behaving?

132
09:28.840 --> 09:33.406
When I first met her, she seemed very friendly.

133
09:34.860 --> 09:38.986
She told me that she'd been Anda's fan for a very long time.

134
09:39.640 --> 09:41.813
She really seemed to like Anda.

135
09:43.660 --> 09:46.110
But the news says she's Anda's hater.

136
09:46.110 --> 09:51.080
And based on all the information, there seems to be a personal grudge.

137
09:51.080 --> 09:52.330
Yes.

138
09:52.330 --> 09:54.290
I don't understand that part either.

139
09:54.290 --> 09:57.520
Have you ever been to her room?

140
09:59.370 --> 10:00.926
No, never.

141
10:01.680 --> 10:06.160
We usually met in the elevator or in front of the condo.

142
10:07.904 --> 10:09.006
But...

143
10:11.520 --> 10:13.826
the last few times I met Amp,

144
10:15.460 --> 10:17.470
something seemed off.

145
10:17.470 --> 10:19.800
She often had bruises.

146
10:19.800 --> 10:21.213
What now?

147
10:23.650 --> 10:25.626
It seemed like she knew James,

148
10:27.000 --> 10:29.300
who was Anda's shipping partner.

149
10:30.360 --> 10:32.200
James?

150
10:32.200 --> 10:33.960
Interesting.

151
10:33.960 --> 10:40.010
The day Amp was exposed was the same day I took her to the hospital.

152
10:40.010 --> 10:41.720
The identity of Anda's hater.

153
10:41.720 --> 10:45.200
- However, we have to blur her face for now. - Right.

154
10:45.840 --> 10:46.410
Can you walk?

155
10:46.410 --> 10:47.690
- That day... - Yes.

156
10:47.690 --> 10:50.290
I saw blood running down her legs.

157
10:50.290 --> 10:51.893
What about my baby?

158
10:52.530 --> 10:55.226
The nurse said the baby is safe.

159
10:56.333 --> 11:01.266
It was only when she got to the hospital that I found out she was pregnant.

160
11:03.400 --> 11:06.450
I also got this information from the hospital.

161
11:06.450 --> 11:10.800
But what's weird is that she chose to run away.

162
11:11.920 --> 11:15.520
If you haven't done anything wrong, you won't need to run away.

163
11:18.720 --> 11:20.693
So, what's your next move, sir?

164
11:21.920 --> 11:25.610
Right now, my team is checking all the addresses.

165
11:25.610 --> 11:27.930
We'll look into it from every angle.

166
11:27.930 --> 11:30.319
I won't let her go easily.

167
11:31.080 --> 11:34.126
I'll drag whoever killed Anda off to prison.

168
11:36.480 --> 11:41.160
If you two have any information, feel free to call me anytime.

169
11:41.160 --> 11:42.839
Thank you both very much.

170
11:44.390 --> 11:45.826
Okay.

171
11:46.720 --> 11:47.886
Let's go.

172
11:52.920 --> 11:55.400
And where are you two heading now?

173
11:57.093 --> 12:00.663
I'm taking him to stay with me.

174
12:00.663 --> 12:03.633
I don't want to leave him alone. It's dangerous.

175
12:06.400 --> 12:08.770
I'll head out now.

176
12:08.770 --> 12:10.450
Sorry for taking up your time.

177
12:10.450 --> 12:13.710
Remember, call me anytime.

178
12:13.710 --> 12:15.776
- Yes, sir. - Of course, sir.

179
12:15.776 --> 12:17.560
I'm off.

180
12:17.560 --> 12:19.193
- Goodbye. - Goodbye.

181
12:36.687 --> 12:38.839
Your place is so tidy.

182
12:43.140 --> 12:44.419
Hey!

183
12:49.640 --> 12:51.166
What are you doing?

184
12:54.680 --> 12:57.653
What? I'm just going to shower.

185
12:59.180 --> 13:01.310
Please.

186
13:01.310 --> 13:04.720
Could you please warn me before you do something like this?

187
13:04.720 --> 13:06.140
What's with you?

188
13:06.140 --> 13:09.280
I'm tired from driving. I just want to shower.

189
13:09.280 --> 13:11.504
You love playing with my feelings, don't you?

190
13:12.820 --> 13:14.230
Fine.

191
13:14.230 --> 13:16.066
I'm going to take a shower now.

192
13:25.210 --> 13:27.720
I'm taking my pants off now.

193
13:29.740 --> 13:31.870
Dammit, Jinna!

194
13:31.870 --> 13:33.370
What is wrong with you?

195
13:33.370 --> 13:36.873
You're the one who told me to warn you before I do anything.

196
13:38.420 --> 13:39.470
Get lost!

197
13:39.470 --> 13:41.460
Just go do whatever you want.

198
13:41.460 --> 13:42.839
Go!

199
14:12.976 --> 14:15.536
[The Moses Stone by James Becker]

200
14:27.200 --> 14:28.895
Did you sleep well?

201
14:28.895 --> 14:30.020
Yeah.

202
14:31.020 --> 14:33.800
Go take a shower quickly. Or we'll miss it.

203
14:36.530 --> 14:38.860
We're going to see a movie today.

204
14:38.860 --> 14:40.510
Which one?

205
14:40.510 --> 14:42.220
The one you wanted to see.

206
14:42.220 --> 14:43.010
Which one was it?

207
14:43.010 --> 14:45.010
What! You forgot already?

208
14:45.010 --> 14:46.466
Go shower.

209
14:47.120 --> 14:48.653
Or do you want me to bathe you?

210
14:49.648 --> 14:52.624
[Movie House]

211
15:03.390 --> 15:04.753
Next time,

212
15:05.960 --> 15:09.713
let me be the one to choose the movie.

213
15:13.740 --> 15:15.133
Are you scared?

214
15:29.040 --> 15:30.833
Just eat it yourself.

215
15:36.140 --> 15:37.833
You're having fun?

216
15:38.786 --> 15:40.520
Of course I am.

217
15:40.520 --> 15:42.794
Every movie is fun when I'm watching it with you.

218
15:46.440 --> 15:48.333
You can hold my hand. Want to?

219
16:03.650 --> 16:06.533
You're such a scaredy-cat. There was nothing.

220
16:07.710 --> 16:09.400
Just eat this.

221
16:09.400 --> 16:11.313
You have some, too.

222
16:13.408 --> 16:16.410
[Movie House]

223
16:16.410 --> 16:18.280
That ghost at the end was so intense.

224
16:18.280 --> 16:20.040
I saw you keeping your eyes closed.

225
16:20.040 --> 16:21.680
You're exaggerating.

226
16:21.680 --> 16:23.970
I was fine.

227
16:23.970 --> 16:26.250
Okay, pick whatever you want for the next one.

228
16:26.250 --> 16:26.880
Definitely.

229
16:26.880 --> 16:31.270
I thought engineering and sports science students didn't get along.

230
16:31.270 --> 16:33.220
Risa, you're here for a movie, too?

231
16:33.220 --> 16:35.550
- Yeah. - Hey, is it the same movie?

232
16:35.550 --> 16:38.940
Yeah. Don't spoil it!

233
16:38.940 --> 16:40.580
It's fun. Not that scary.

234
16:40.580 --> 16:42.310
Two out of ten.

235
16:42.310 --> 16:45.413
That means it's really scary.

236
16:46.900 --> 16:49.819
I'm so jealous. You have someone to watch movies with.

237
16:51.150 --> 16:55.520
And aren't those two your friends?

238
16:58.390 --> 17:00.555
I'm just teasing you guys.

239
17:00.555 --> 17:06.060
So... are you two dating now?

240
17:07.007 --> 17:08.600
Yes.

241
17:08.600 --> 17:09.639
Right?

242
17:11.680 --> 17:12.993
Yeah.

243
17:13.610 --> 17:16.746
But if others find out that students from these two faculties are dating,

244
17:17.380 --> 17:19.773
it might be a bit strange.

245
17:20.920 --> 17:22.060
It's fine.

246
17:22.060 --> 17:25.130
I don't intend to hide it anyway.

247
17:25.130 --> 17:27.020
I'd like others to know as well.

248
17:29.060 --> 17:30.620
I'll be right back.

249
17:30.620 --> 17:32.760
I'm going to the toilet for a second.

250
17:32.760 --> 17:34.000
You two go ahead and chat.

251
17:36.500 --> 17:38.293
Congratulations.

252
17:40.300 --> 17:42.820
Look, stop acting so clueless.

253
17:42.820 --> 17:46.400
Do you really not know that Jinna is into you?

254
17:47.800 --> 17:52.650
But I haven't even said yes to him yet.

255
17:52.650 --> 17:56.813
But Jinna made up his mind long ago.

256
18:02.440 --> 18:05.500
Are you really serious about him?

257
18:06.928 --> 18:08.033
Yeah.

258
18:08.740 --> 18:11.000
I'm very serious about Podduang.

259
18:14.100 --> 18:17.590
At first, I didn't think that he was this serious.

260
18:17.590 --> 18:21.790
I thought he was always that kind of guy.

261
18:21.790 --> 18:24.935
But I clearly remember the look on his face

262
18:24.935 --> 18:27.793
when he said he was serious about you.

263
18:30.560 --> 18:34.280
Gosh, I can't enjoy the movie anymore.

264
18:36.150 --> 18:38.496
Are you going? The ads are almost over.

265
18:38.496 --> 18:39.766
Okay.

266
18:40.790 --> 18:44.386
Don't let me catch you at college, or I'll die of jealousy.

267
18:54.840 --> 18:56.280
Let's head back.

268
18:56.280 --> 18:57.286
Yeah.

269
19:00.080 --> 19:01.933
- Just a second. - Okay.

270
19:04.780 --> 19:07.184
[Don't get involved in Anda's case if you still want to live.]

271
19:10.080 --> 19:11.400
Are you okay?

272
19:16.420 --> 19:18.816
[Don't get involved in Anda's case if you still want to live.]

273
19:22.980 --> 19:24.813
How do they know you?

274
19:29.130 --> 19:31.393
We should report this to the police.

275
19:36.830 --> 19:39.230
[Royal Thai Police Incident Report]

276
19:39.230 --> 19:41.880
Good thing I brought you here first.

277
19:41.880 --> 19:44.280
Otherwise, we'd be in real trouble.

278
19:44.280 --> 19:47.200
Even the police can't figure out who the number belongs to.

279
19:48.640 --> 19:51.326
Do you think it's Amp?

280
19:53.370 --> 19:54.879
I'm not sure.

281
19:55.590 --> 19:57.340
It's possible, though.

282
19:59.366 --> 20:00.653
But...

283
20:01.550 --> 20:03.719
Why would she do something like that?

284
20:05.380 --> 20:08.813
She knows we're investigating this. That's why.

285
20:18.370 --> 20:20.026
Can't sleep?

286
20:22.099 --> 20:23.503
Just have a lot on my mind.

287
20:26.640 --> 20:28.219
Me too.

288
20:34.050 --> 20:35.813
I really want to see Amp.

289
20:39.076 --> 20:41.826
Aren't Bum and Dunk helping us find her?

290
20:44.200 --> 20:45.646
Yeah.

291
20:49.080 --> 20:51.045
You don't believe it, do you?

292
20:51.045 --> 20:52.933
That Amp was the one who did it?

293
20:55.648 --> 20:56.906
No.

294
21:03.470 --> 21:05.353
Don't you worry.

295
21:06.430 --> 21:09.110
We have to find whoever killed Anda.

296
21:09.110 --> 21:11.186
Everyone is helping us right now.

297
21:14.880 --> 21:16.306
Get some sleep now.

298
21:23.712 --> 21:24.913
It's okay.

299
22:49.360 --> 22:50.740
Jinna.

300
22:54.330 --> 22:56.333
It's cremation day.

301
22:58.480 --> 23:01.600
Anda. How are you doing?

302
23:03.420 --> 23:05.713
We're so close to figuring out the truth.

303
23:06.760 --> 23:09.770
2807.

304
23:09.770 --> 23:11.310
At home.

305
23:11.310 --> 23:13.240
The bedroom.

306
23:13.240 --> 23:14.853
I want it.

307
23:18.520 --> 23:20.526
2807.

308
23:29.660 --> 23:31.760
Are you going to sleep, Bum?

309
23:32.480 --> 23:35.700
It feels like we're not students anymore at this point.

310
23:37.170 --> 23:39.606
Are you studying sports science just to become a detective?

311
23:42.540 --> 23:45.120
Nothing gets past me.

312
23:45.120 --> 23:47.926
Don't say that. It gives me the creeps.

313
24:16.320 --> 24:19.690
Cyber police are helping us trace the number's location.

314
24:19.690 --> 24:22.810
And I've already had local police visit her home.

315
24:22.810 --> 24:26.080
But the suspect's parents keep denying everything,

316
24:26.080 --> 24:29.026
saying their daughter hasn't been home for years.

317
24:31.560 --> 24:33.460
Thank you, Lieutenant.

318
24:33.460 --> 24:36.106
That doesn't even include what happened early this morning.

319
24:37.040 --> 24:38.280
What happened?

320
24:46.070 --> 24:48.840
Remember the account I showed you?

321
24:48.840 --> 24:51.153
It's active again.

322
24:52.136 --> 24:55.460
And this time, jealousy is clearly the motive.

323
24:55.460 --> 24:58.170
Amp, James's girlfriend...

324
24:58.170 --> 25:00.566
James was your brother's shipping partner.

325
25:01.190 --> 25:03.960
They've fought over this many times.

326
25:03.960 --> 25:05.173
James.

327
25:06.190 --> 25:07.566
That's interesting.

328
25:08.760 --> 25:11.620
And do you know where James is now?

329
25:11.620 --> 25:13.326
We still can't reach him.

330
25:24.706 --> 25:25.800
Yes?

331
25:25.800 --> 25:27.806
He called again, Boss.

332
25:29.350 --> 25:32.520
He said the money wasn't enough.

333
25:32.520 --> 25:34.213
What should we do?

334
25:38.940 --> 25:41.560
It's become a hot topic on social media again

335
25:41.560 --> 25:43.870
after it was revealed that the suspect, Amp,

336
25:43.870 --> 25:46.820
is James's girlfriend,

337
25:46.820 --> 25:49.600
Anda's longtime shipping partner.

338
25:49.600 --> 25:52.270
This incident is suspected to have been caused by jealousy

339
25:52.270 --> 25:55.750
because Amp and James have been dating for a long time.

340
25:55.750 --> 26:00.770
An account has posted crucial evidence including photos and messages,

341
26:00.770 --> 26:05.200
that undeniably proves the two are in a relationship.

342
26:21.320 --> 26:26.846
It's time for me to let Anda go.

343
26:31.010 --> 26:34.440
I still dream about Anda as a little boy.

344
26:37.470 --> 26:38.926
I...

345
26:39.930 --> 26:41.920
I miss Anda, too.

346
26:48.840 --> 26:50.000
Jinna.

347
26:53.820 --> 26:56.670
Is it true what they say?

348
26:56.670 --> 26:58.926
That there's someone who caused...

349
27:00.695 --> 27:03.200
Anda to...

350
27:03.200 --> 27:04.326
Jinna.

351
27:05.250 --> 27:06.560
Hello, sir.

352
27:06.560 --> 27:07.840
Hello.

353
27:10.220 --> 27:12.480
I'm going to prepare for the cremation.

354
27:12.480 --> 27:13.840
Do you want to come along?

355
27:17.910 --> 27:20.126
Sir, Ma'am.

356
27:23.080 --> 27:25.933
Anda really loved you both.

357
27:30.390 --> 27:34.800
I still feel like Anda is right here.

358
27:34.800 --> 27:37.090
Anda is still here.

359
27:37.090 --> 27:39.546
Anda hasn't gone anywhere.

360
27:49.350 --> 27:50.906
Sir, Ma'am.

361
27:53.800 --> 27:55.833
I have something to ask you.

362
28:00.340 --> 28:02.633
2807.

363
28:03.370 --> 28:04.830
At home.

364
28:04.830 --> 28:06.800
The bedroom.

365
28:06.800 --> 28:08.200
I want it.

366
28:10.830 --> 28:13.166
Do you happen to know...

367
28:13.846 --> 28:21.533
what "2807, at home, bedroom" means?

368
28:26.950 --> 28:28.733
2807.

369
28:30.110 --> 28:33.520
Aren't those our birthdays, honey?

370
28:33.520 --> 28:35.460
2807.

371
28:36.230 --> 28:38.046
How do you know?

372
28:40.340 --> 28:42.313
Anda told me, Mom.

373
28:43.500 --> 28:46.206
Look, Jinna.

374
28:47.700 --> 28:50.000
Don't talk such nonsense.

375
28:50.000 --> 28:52.080
Mom is already grieving enough.

376
28:52.080 --> 28:55.400
I understand that it sounds strange.

377
28:55.400 --> 28:59.893
But could you try to recall this number and the bedroom?

378
29:06.780 --> 29:11.226
Or is it that box that...

379
29:11.950 --> 29:13.620
I'll be right back.

380
29:22.200 --> 29:28.680
When I was tidying up Anda's room, this was the only locked box.

381
29:28.680 --> 29:31.320
Could it be the code?

382
29:58.680 --> 30:01.600
[I want to be a prosecutor like my dad.]

383
30:15.170 --> 30:18.576
[If I don't want to be a prosecutor anymore, will my dad be disappointed in me?]

384
30:29.920 --> 30:33.390
[If my mom knows that I like my friend, will she be happy?]

385
30:38.750 --> 30:40.500
Anda said...

386
30:43.080 --> 30:45.440
if the day came when he had to go,

387
30:46.460 --> 30:51.133
he wanted you two to bring the box to the cremation as well.

388
30:53.540 --> 30:57.806
Sir, Anda definitely didn't take his own life.

389
31:00.350 --> 31:02.688
I will find the person who did this to Anda

390
31:03.870 --> 31:05.679
and make them pay.

391
31:08.496 --> 31:10.340
Please ask Anda...

392
31:14.530 --> 31:16.326
how he is doing.

393
31:30.080 --> 31:31.159
And...

394
31:32.130 --> 31:35.340
If you need anything, you can tell me.

395
31:35.340 --> 31:37.520
I'm willing to help.

396
31:37.520 --> 31:42.943
Yes, but please don't tell anyone about this yet.

397
31:44.453 --> 31:46.620
It was Anda's wish.

398
31:49.130 --> 31:51.420
He wanted only the two of you to know.

399
32:10.180 --> 32:12.410
Hello, Itti.

400
32:12.410 --> 32:13.813
What are you doing here?

401
32:14.710 --> 32:17.380
I just came to visit Sir and Ma'am.

402
32:19.400 --> 32:21.390
So, how's it going?

403
32:21.390 --> 32:23.660
Have you found anything more suspicious?

404
32:23.660 --> 32:27.340
We're investigating separately, looking into each thing one by one.

405
32:27.340 --> 32:29.560
Both the car and the CCTV.

406
32:29.560 --> 32:31.560
Everything looks suspicious.

407
32:32.920 --> 32:34.310
I think so, too.

408
32:34.310 --> 32:37.226
Podduang just got a threatening text.

409
32:37.870 --> 32:39.330
A text?

410
32:39.330 --> 32:41.659
Yes, telling him to stop getting involved in this.

411
32:42.350 --> 32:44.440
I think that's dangerous.

412
32:44.440 --> 32:46.133
Have you reported it to the police yet?

413
32:46.760 --> 32:47.800
Yes.

414
32:50.533 --> 32:54.770
From now on, you and your friends should be careful.

415
32:54.770 --> 32:57.560
Don't put yourself in unnecessary danger.

416
32:57.560 --> 32:59.280
Let the police handle it.

417
33:01.860 --> 33:03.570
Yes.

418
33:03.570 --> 33:05.600
Then I'll take my leave.

419
33:05.600 --> 33:06.973
Goodbye.

420
33:35.393 --> 33:37.013
My brother's got it bad.

421
33:37.826 --> 33:39.430
What was that?

422
33:39.430 --> 33:41.790
Nothing. It's nothing.

423
33:41.790 --> 33:44.370
You don't really have to stay here with me.

424
33:44.370 --> 33:46.040
I can look after myself.

425
33:46.040 --> 33:47.640
Stop acting so tough.

426
33:47.640 --> 33:49.233
Just eat your food.

427
33:51.240 --> 33:53.630
You've been checking your phone all day.

428
33:53.630 --> 33:55.013
So, are you two official yet?

429
33:59.870 --> 34:01.146
I knew it.

430
34:02.150 --> 34:03.613
That silence says it all.

431
34:04.520 --> 34:07.200
- You guys have done it, haven't you? - Satang! You little brat!

432
34:07.200 --> 34:09.280
Come on, Podduang. We're adults now.

433
34:09.280 --> 34:11.479
It's 2026.

434
34:11.479 --> 34:14.280
Siblings don't keep secrets anymore.

435
34:14.280 --> 34:16.940
What do you mean, "It's 2026"?

436
34:16.940 --> 34:18.960
You're such a smartass. Don't forget I'm your older brother.

437
34:18.960 --> 34:21.240
By the way, do you know what your name is?

438
34:21.240 --> 34:22.650
What name?

439
34:22.650 --> 34:23.800
Podduang...

440
34:23.800 --> 34:25.280
Yeah, so?

441
34:25.280 --> 34:26.633
Ronnarak.

442
34:29.200 --> 34:30.779
You jerk.

443
34:54.530 --> 34:58.640
I already told you to leave me and Auntie Amphon alone.

444
34:58.640 --> 35:02.110
Master really wants to talk to you, Mr. Jinna.

445
35:02.110 --> 35:05.286
Someone who truly wants to talk wouldn't send a lawyer.

446
35:25.760 --> 35:28.413
I want you to come back to our home.

447
35:33.333 --> 35:36.039
You can bring your aunt with you, too.

448
35:37.030 --> 35:39.039
Why do you want me to come back?

449
35:40.106 --> 35:42.713
To be a puppet for your business again?

450
35:44.624 --> 35:45.926
Yes.

451
35:46.900 --> 35:51.240
If that's what you think, then my answer is yes.

452
35:57.520 --> 35:59.253
How have you been?

453
36:00.057 --> 36:02.400
You've been having the lawyer check on me all this time.

454
36:03.010 --> 36:04.519
So you should already know.

455
36:10.673 --> 36:11.873
Jinna...

456
36:14.360 --> 36:15.740
I'm sorry.

457
36:15.740 --> 36:17.280
There's no need for you to apologize.

458
36:18.210 --> 36:20.393
You never loved me or Mom anyway.

459
36:22.100 --> 36:23.959
You only care about your assets.

460
36:30.592 --> 36:31.806
Yes.

461
36:33.000 --> 36:37.513
In the past, I really did love my assets.

462
36:39.280 --> 36:40.606
That's why...

463
36:41.560 --> 36:44.240
I want to leave all of it to you.

464
36:54.848 --> 36:56.320
Hello.

465
36:56.320 --> 36:58.100
What are you doing?

466
36:58.100 --> 37:00.810
Just scrolling through the news.

467
37:00.810 --> 37:03.020
Looking for any updates on Amp.

468
37:03.020 --> 37:05.260
But Bum's been keeping a close eye on it, too.

469
37:05.260 --> 37:06.590
So, who are you with?

470
37:06.590 --> 37:07.530
Where's Satang?

471
37:07.530 --> 37:09.413
Satang's busy playing games.

472
37:09.980 --> 37:11.480
And you?

473
37:11.480 --> 37:12.839
What are you up to?

474
37:14.160 --> 37:16.333
I'm busy thinking of you.

475
37:19.010 --> 37:20.920
The bed is so big.

476
37:20.920 --> 37:24.560
I don't know how I can sleep here all by myself.

477
37:24.560 --> 37:25.910
Look who's talking.

478
37:25.910 --> 37:28.073
You've been sleeping alone for years.

479
37:28.720 --> 37:30.030
Wait...

480
37:30.030 --> 37:31.566
Or was I wrong?

481
37:32.410 --> 37:33.690
What?

482
37:33.690 --> 37:36.039
I really do sleep alone.

483
37:38.800 --> 37:40.326
Who is it?

484
37:41.720 --> 37:43.326
I don't know.

485
37:44.960 --> 37:46.406
Satang.

486
37:47.230 --> 37:48.440
Satang!

487
37:53.430 --> 37:55.846
Hey, are you really opening the door?

488
38:09.360 --> 38:11.133
Fried chicken delivery!

489
38:13.410 --> 38:15.346
Satang!

490
38:17.800 --> 38:20.500
Sorry. I forgot about the chicken.

491
38:20.500 --> 38:22.353
- Can I scan the QR code to pay? - Yes.

492
38:24.520 --> 38:26.680
I'm getting so paranoid.

493
38:26.680 --> 38:28.546
That's all. I'm going to eat now.

494
38:33.500 --> 38:35.560
Are you done talking to Jinna yet?

495
38:35.560 --> 38:37.113
Can't you see for yourself?

496
38:45.680 --> 38:52.880
[Mr. Chanin]

497
38:59.088 --> 39:02.800
[The Honor Yothinpattana]

498
39:13.320 --> 39:16.400
I'll return and take over your business.

499
39:16.400 --> 39:18.780
But I have two conditions.

500
39:19.330 --> 39:23.093
You have to let me see every CCTV camera in your condo.

501
39:25.320 --> 39:28.053
- Have a seat. - That's my offer.

502
39:30.310 --> 39:32.940
Sit down first, then I'll grant your request.

503
39:43.950 --> 39:47.939
I have no problem with your conditions.

504
39:48.570 --> 39:51.340
Honestly, I haven't been neglecting it.

505
39:51.340 --> 39:53.720
You can see for yourself

506
39:53.720 --> 39:57.183
whether the camera I mentioned is really broken.

507
39:58.040 --> 40:00.086
I've been trying to help you, too.

508
40:00.813 --> 40:03.879
Fine. I'll definitely check them all.

509
40:05.760 --> 40:07.133
Lawyer,

510
40:07.880 --> 40:10.120
have a technician ready to assist Jinna.

511
40:10.120 --> 40:11.506
Yes, sir.

512
40:12.720 --> 40:14.550
One more thing...

513
40:14.550 --> 40:16.879
I want you to look after my people.

514
40:19.350 --> 40:20.773
Your people?

515
40:22.153 --> 40:23.226
Yes.

516
40:35.730 --> 40:37.670
Then come back and live at our house.

517
40:37.670 --> 40:40.660
I only promised to take over the business.

518
40:40.660 --> 40:42.926
I'll decide about moving back later.

519
40:54.120 --> 40:56.200
This is absolutely grand.

520
40:56.200 --> 40:59.700
No one's going to mind us being here?

521
40:59.700 --> 41:02.166
I asked my father to help.

522
41:02.166 --> 41:05.200
If I didn't know you,

523
41:05.200 --> 41:08.760
I'd definitely think you were the owner's son.

524
41:08.760 --> 41:11.680
Then who is your father?

525
41:14.386 --> 41:16.560
So? What?

526
41:16.560 --> 41:18.506
What's with the nodding?

527
41:18.506 --> 41:21.526
I asked the condo owner for help.

528
41:22.930 --> 41:24.200
Shit!

529
41:24.200 --> 41:28.540
So it turns out you're the chairman's son.

530
41:31.720 --> 41:34.746
Why didn't I ever know that?

531
41:35.857 --> 41:38.146
I never told anyone.

532
41:38.146 --> 41:40.210
Only Auntie Amphon knows.

533
41:40.210 --> 41:41.653
Besides...

534
41:42.377 --> 41:44.553
I don't really want to be his son anyway.

535
41:45.570 --> 41:47.610
So how's it going?

536
41:47.610 --> 41:50.190
Did you find anything off?

537
41:50.190 --> 41:53.230
I hope the camera captured everything clearly.

538
41:53.230 --> 41:55.120
So this can finally be over.

539
41:55.120 --> 41:56.683
I haven't found anything yet.

540
41:59.280 --> 42:01.070
Can you zoom in on this camera for me a bit?

541
42:01.070 --> 42:02.306
Yes, I can.

542
42:17.088 --> 42:19.520
- You're losing chips. - Here.

543
42:19.520 --> 42:21.393
The dealer made the first move.

544
42:22.064 --> 42:23.819
Good throw!

545
42:33.880 --> 42:35.425
I promise, sir.

546
42:35.425 --> 42:37.720
I'll get the money and pay you back as soon as possible.

547
42:37.720 --> 42:40.153
I've really been struggling lately.

548
42:40.153 --> 42:43.720
I can't reach my wife. I don't know where she went.

549
42:43.720 --> 42:45.820
Can I have two days?

550
42:45.820 --> 42:47.593
I promise.

551
42:47.593 --> 42:49.759
I'll pay you back as soon as possible.

552
42:51.586 --> 42:53.940
You're quite impressive.

553
42:53.940 --> 42:56.899
Finding two million in just two days?

554
43:15.960 --> 43:17.540
I'm sorry.

555
43:18.280 --> 43:20.120
I really do promise.

556
43:20.120 --> 43:22.046
I'll definitely get the money.

557
43:35.520 --> 43:36.910
Yes.

558
43:36.910 --> 43:38.660
Hey, you.

559
43:38.660 --> 43:42.260
I don't think the money you gave me is enough.

560
43:42.260 --> 43:46.200
I want to ask for another million, okay?

561
43:46.200 --> 43:50.120
I know your boss wouldn't even feel it.

562
43:53.600 --> 43:54.753
Boss.

563
43:55.600 --> 43:57.406
He's asking for another million.

564
43:59.840 --> 44:02.393
I've found someone with even worse luck than you.

565
44:05.860 --> 44:08.250
Go drag him over.

566
44:08.250 --> 44:12.593
And take this bastard to see for himself what happens

567
44:12.593 --> 44:15.273
when you mess with me.

568
44:34.600 --> 44:38.110
Ever since what happened to Anda, your life has been in constant danger.

569
44:38.110 --> 44:40.100
I don't want anything to happen to you.

570
44:40.100 --> 44:41.320
You're too nice.

571
44:41.320 --> 44:44.350
If you make Podduang sad, I won't go easy on you.

572
44:44.350 --> 44:46.260
We've come this far.

573
44:46.260 --> 44:47.560
Let's end this matter.

574
44:47.560 --> 44:49.560
I found the garage where Anda got his car fixed.

575
44:49.560 --> 44:51.430
I found something in the footage.

576
44:51.430 --> 44:53.350
That's one of Itti's men.

577
44:53.350 --> 44:55.520
Do you want your debt to be wiped out?

578
44:55.520 --> 44:56.720
What do you want me to do?

579
44:56.720 --> 44:58.273
Can I come in?

580
44:59.400 --> 45:00.780
Podduang isn't answering my calls.

581
45:00.780 --> 45:02.480
Jinna.

582
45:02.480 --> 45:04.073
Go help Podduang!
